[00:00.00] Lyrics by : 史俊威
[00:01.00] Composed by : 史俊威
[00:02.00] Arranged by : 苏打绿
[00:03.00] Produced by : 苏打绿/徐千秀
[00:37.87]I'm so in love with you in the morning
[00:46.08]When I start to think of you tears are falling
[00:53.84]It doesn't matter no one sees you bleeding
[01:02.00]But I want you to know that I hear you crying
[01:09.84]You said: "Anyone can show me where to be?"
[01:19.48]"Anyone can show me where to be?"
[01:45.86]You have a heart that I still believe in
[01:53.71]You'll never lose it if you try to stop all the fighting
[02:01.75]It doesn't matter if you feel like nothing
[02:09.71]You know I love you and I'll sing the song with blessing
[02:18.00]Sing it: "Everyone can show you where to live"
[02:27.34]"Everyone can show you where to live"
[03:23.71]"Everyone can show me where to be"
[03:31.45]"Everyone can show me where to live"
[03:39.40]"Everyone can show me where to be"
[03:47.40]"Everyone can show me where to breathe"
[03:55.46]"Everyone should know we have to give"
